hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1292","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala and Issa bin Ibrahim Al-Ghafiqi told us, they said: Ibn Wahb told us, on the authority of Ibrahim bin Nashit, on the authority of Abdullah Bin Abdul Rahman Bin Hussein, on the authority of Ata Bin Abi Rabah, on the authority of Jabir Bin Abdullah, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “Whoever digs water and does not drink from it the live liver of a jinn, human, or bird, God will reward him on the Day of Resurrection, and whoever builds a mosque as an examiner.” A cat or a small bird, God will build a house for him in Paradise.” Yunus said: From a bird or a bird, and he said: Like a cat examining a cat."
